---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = '2026-11-09';
const seo = {
  title: "Value Research Alternative India (2026) — Arthavi vs Value Research | Arthavi",
  description: "Looking for a Value Research alternative? Arthavi offers free portfolio tracking with CAS import, cash-flow XIRR, capital gains reports, family portfolios, and AI analytics — with full transaction history and privacy-first architecture.",
};

const schema = JSON.stringify({
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "WebPage",
      "@id": "https://arthavi.com/alternatives/value-research/#webpage",
      "url": "https://arthavi.com/alternatives/value-research/",
      "name": seo.title,
      "description": seo.description,
      "dateModified": lastUpdated,
      "publisher": { "@id": "https://arthavi.com/#organization" }
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is Value Research Portfolio Manager free?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes, Value Research offers a free Portfolio Manager with automated transaction imports via MF Central, covering mutual funds, stocks, NPS, PPF, SGBs, and bonds. Arthavi is also free and additionally provides broker tradebook CSV import, SIF/AIF tracking, cash-flow XIRR, capital gains reports, and an AI assistant."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Does Value Research have automated CAS import?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. Value Research's Portfolio Manager advertises automated transaction imports through MF Central with OTP verification. Arthavi imports CAMS and KFintech CAS PDFs directly in under 30 seconds with client-side decryption — no password storage."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What does Arthavi offer that Value Research does not?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Arthavi adds SIF and AIF specialized fund tracking, NSE/BSE live stock portfolio with broker tradebook CSV import, broker tradebook reconciliation, capital gains LTCG/STCG reports with Section 112A grandfathering, an AI portfolio assistant, and family multi-PAN aggregation — all in one dashboard."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
});
---
<Layout
  title={seo.title}
  description={seo.description}
  keywords="value research alternative, value research portfolio manager alternative, arthavi vs value research, free portfolio tracker india, value research online alternative, mutual fund portfolio tracker"
  schema={schema}
  breadcrumb={{
    items: [
      { name: "Home", url: "https://arthavi.com/" },
      { name: "Alternatives", url: "https://arthavi.com/compare/" },
      { name: "Value Research Alternative", url: "https://arthavi.com/alternatives/value-research/" }
    ]
  }}
>

<main class="container">
  <section class="page-header fade-in" style="text-align: center; padding: 4rem 0 1.5rem; margin-top: 31px;">
    <p style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: #10B981; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1); padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);">
      <span>✓</span> Last verified: {lastUpdated} (Feature and pricing audit)
    </p>
    <h1>Arthavi vs Value Research — Portfolio Tracker Comparison (2026)</h1>
  </section>

  <!-- AEO Direct Answer Block -->
  <div class="aeo-answer-block fade-in" style="max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto 3rem; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 16px; background: rgba(99,102,241,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(99,102,241,0.2);">
    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-body);">
      <strong style="color: var(--text-head);">Both Arthavi and Value Research offer free portfolio tracking with automated CAS import.</strong>
      Arthavi focuses on transaction-level accuracy, SIF/AIF support, capital gains reports, and an AI portfolio assistant. Value Research is stronger on fund research, ratings, and editorial analysis. This page covers what each does well and where they differ.
    </p>
  </div>

  <article class="prose fade-in delay-100" style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">

    <h2>What Value Research Portfolio Manager offers</h2>
    <p>Value Research is one of India's most established mutual fund research platforms. Its free Portfolio Manager (as of November 2026) includes:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Automated transaction imports via MF Central (OTP-verified)</li>
      <li>Mutual funds, stocks, NPS, PPF, SGBs, bonds, fixed income, and alternatives</li>
      <li>Family investment tracking</li>
      <li>Dividends, bonuses, rights, and splits</li>
      <li>Tax statements and portfolio performance comparisons</li>
      <li>SIF listing and portfolio tracking</li>
      <li>Fund ratings, editorial analysis, and screener tools</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Value Research is a serious free alternative. Its fund research ecosystem and editorial content are genuinely strong, and its automated import via MF Central works without uploading a PDF.</p>

    <h2>How Arthavi compares to Value Research</h2>
    <div class="compare-table-wrap" style="margin: 2rem 0;">
      <table class="compare-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Feature</th>
            <th class="col-arthavi">Arthavi</th>
            <th>Value Research</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Price</strong></td>
            <td class="col-arthavi">Free forever (core tracking)</td>
            <td>Free Portfolio Manager</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Import method</strong></td>
            <td class="col-arthavi">CAMS/KFintech CAS PDF — client-side decryption, zero password storage</td>
            <td>MF Central OTP flow, automated imports</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Transaction history</strong></td>
            <td class="col-arthavi">Full history from CAS: every SIP, switch, redemption, dividend</td>
            <td>Transaction-level import via MF Central</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>XIRR calculation</strong></td>
            <td class="col-arthavi">Cash-flow accurate XIRR — exact dates per transaction</td>
            <td>Portfolio performance comparisons available</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Capital gains reports</strong></td>
            <td class="col-arthavi">LTCG/STCG with Section 112A grandfathering, CSV export</td>
            <td>Tax statements available</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Stock tracking</strong></td>
            <td class="col-arthavi">Live NSE/BSE, broker tradebook CSV import, no broker login</td>
            <td>Stocks supported</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>SIF / AIF tracking</strong></td>
            <td class="col-arthavi">Automated daily SIF NAV, AIF commitment ledger</td>
            <td>SIF listing and tracking</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Family portfolios</strong></td>
            <td class="col-arthavi">Multi-PAN family aggregation, unlimited profiles</td>
            <td>Family investment tracking</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>AI assistant</strong></td>
            <td class="col-arthavi">Ask AI: overlap detection, sector concentration, plain-English Q&amp;A</td>
            <td>No AI portfolio assistant</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Fund research</strong></td>
            <td class="col-arthavi">Portfolio analytics focus — no editorial fund ratings</td>
            <td>Extensive: ratings, comparisons, screener, editorial</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Privacy model</strong></td>
            <td class="col-arthavi">Client-side PDF decryption, zero raw storage, no broker login</td>
            <td>MF Central linked flow with OTP</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h2>Where Value Research is stronger</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Fund research ecosystem</strong> — Decades of fund ratings, analyst notes, screener tools, and editorial content that Arthavi does not have.</li>
      <li><strong>Import without a PDF</strong> — MF Central OTP flow pulls transaction data directly, without uploading a file.</li>
      <li><strong>Community and content</strong> — Forums, newsletters, and an established readership for investment education.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Where Arthavi is different</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Client-side PDF decryption</strong> — Your CAMS/KFintech PDF password never leaves your browser. The <a href="/methodology/">methodology page</a> explains the full data flow.</li>
      <li><strong>Broker tradebook import</strong> — Import Zerodha, Groww, Angel One, and Upstox trade CSV files alongside your CAS for a complete stocks + mutual funds view.</li>
      <li><strong>AI assistant on your actual holdings</strong> — Ask questions about your specific portfolio: overlap between funds, sector concentration, emergency fund coverage.</li>
      <li><strong>Capital gains with Section 112A</strong> — LTCG reports with Jan 31, 2018 FMV grandfathering and updated Budget 2024 tax rates, downloadable as CSV.</li>
      <li><strong>SIF automated daily NAV</strong> — Track SEBI's Specialized Investment Funds alongside listed equities and mutual funds in one dashboard.</li>
      <li><strong>CAS Delta Import</strong> — Upload a new monthly CAS without duplicating existing transactions. <a href="/cas-delta-import/">Learn about CAS Delta Import</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Who should use Value Research</h2>
    <p>Value Research is the right choice if your primary need is <strong>fund research, ratings, and investment education</strong> rather than portfolio tracking. Its screener and editorial content are unmatched for investors who want to evaluate funds before buying.</p>

    <h2>Who should use Arthavi</h2>
    <p>Arthavi is the better choice if you want <strong>transaction-level accuracy, capital gains reports, SIF/AIF tracking, broker tradebook reconciliation, or an AI assistant on your actual holdings</strong> — all without broker login or data selling.</p>

    <h2>How to get started with Arthavi</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Download your latest CAS PDF from <a href="/guides/how-to-import-cas-cams-kfintech-nsdl/">CAMS or KFintech</a></li>
      <li>Sign up on <a href="https://app.arthavi.com/register">Arthavi</a> (30 seconds, no broker credentials needed)</li>
      <li>Upload your CAS — your entire mutual fund history appears instantly</li>
      <li>Add stocks via broker tradebook CSV or manual entry</li>
    </ol>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 3rem 0;">
      <a href="https://app.arthavi.com/demo" class="btn btn-demo" style="padding: 1rem 2.5rem; font-size: 1.1rem;">
        Try Arthavi Demo — No Signup Required
      </a>
      <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-muted);">No broker login. No spam calls. Your data stays yours.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ Section -->
    <section id="faq" style="margin-top: 4rem;">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

      <h3>Is Value Research Portfolio Manager free?</h3>
      <p>Yes, Value Research offers a free Portfolio Manager with automated transaction imports via MF Central, covering mutual funds, stocks, NPS, PPF, SGBs, and bonds. Arthavi is also free and additionally provides broker tradebook CSV import, SIF/AIF tracking, cash-flow XIRR, capital gains reports, and an AI assistant.</p>

      <h3>Does Value Research have automated CAS import?</h3>
      <p>Yes. Value Research's Portfolio Manager advertises automated transaction imports through MF Central with OTP verification. Arthavi imports CAMS and KFintech CAS PDFs directly in under 30 seconds with client-side decryption — no password storage on the server.</p>

      <h3>What does Arthavi offer that Value Research does not?</h3>
      <p>Arthavi adds SIF and AIF specialized fund tracking, NSE/BSE live stock portfolio with broker tradebook CSV import, capital gains LTCG/STCG reports with Section 112A grandfathering, an AI portfolio assistant, and CAS Delta Import for duplicate-free monthly updates.</p>

      <h3>Can I use both Arthavi and Value Research?</h3>
      <p>Yes. Many investors use Value Research for fund research and ratings, and Arthavi for portfolio tracking, capital gains reports, and AI analytics on their actual holdings. They serve different primary purposes.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Internal Links -->
    <nav style="margin-top: 3rem; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 16px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Compare other alternatives</h3>
      <ul style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem; list-style: none; padding: 0;">
        <li><a href="/alternatives/mprofit/">Arthavi vs MProfit</a></li>
        <li><a href="/alternatives/indmoney/">Arthavi vs INDmoney</a></li>
        <li><a href="/alternatives/kuvera/">Arthavi vs Kuvera</a></li>
        <li><a href="/arthavi-vs-groww/">Arthavi vs Groww</a></li>
        <li><a href="/compare/">Full Comparison Hub</a></li>
      </ul>
      <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem;">Key features</h3>
      <ul style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem; list-style: none; padding: 0;">
        <li><a href="/cas-delta-import/">CAS Delta Import</a></li>
        <li><a href="/family-portfolio-tracker/">Family Portfolio Tracker</a></li>
        <li><a href="/cas-statement-portfolio-tracker/">CAS Statement Tracker</a></li>
        <li><a href="/methodology/">Privacy &amp; Methodology</a></li>
      </ul>
      <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem;">Free tools</h3>
      <ul style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem; list-style: none; padding: 0;">
        <li><a href="/tools/xirr-calculator/">XIRR Calculator</a></li>
        <li><a href="/tools/sip-return-calculator/">SIP Return Calculator</a></li>
        <li><a href="/tools/mutual-fund-overlap/">Mutual Fund Overlap Checker</a></li>
        <li><a href="/tools/ltcg-stcg-calculator/">LTCG/STCG Tax Calculator</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </article>
</main>

</Layout>

